  (also
   (yam-runtime-require
    (str= (. 0 (yam-runtime-definition (. 0 value) group)) "function")
    "Expected a function" group)
   (. 1 value))))

# "Primitive calls have a compact public representation.

   Expr.op contains an Op enum and an array of expressions. The private
   catalog also includes the three constructors carrying explicit Types.
   These tables translate between the public operation tags and that catalog
